    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Class III, mains-operated, self-indicating, price-computing, single or dual-interval, non-automatic weighing instruments designed for direct sales to the public. Construction: plastic housing, operator's keypad, stainless steel load receptor, front and rear LCD displays (CL3500-B) or pole-mounted double-sided LCD displays (CL3500-P), level indicator, integrated printer. Devices: initial zero setting device, semi-automatic zero setting device, zero tracking device, zero indicator, net indicator, stable weight indicator, semi-automatic subtractive tare balancing device, preset tare, gravity compensation, price-computing, totalisation (including non-weighed items), PLU, fixed weight labelling, multi-vendor operation, calibration/set-up mode via sealed internal switch, self-service operation. Interfaces: RS232C, PS/2, cash drawer, Ethernet, wireless LAN, USB. Note: page 2 of the certificate refers to the family as the CL5500 Series, an apparent typographical error for CL3500 Series."
